# House rule for this addon: every text file is LF and BOM-free, with no exceptions, the layers
# included. Storing CRLF produced a whole-file diff every time a Workbench save rewrote a file, and
# the packer reads LF sources cleanly (proven by a clean pack of all four addons).
* text eol=lf

# Binary resources: never text-normalise these.
*.edds binary
*.pak binary
*.rdb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttile binary
*.terr binary
